# Agent Learning Loop Trigger

Read and follow `.cursor/skills/agent-learning-loop/SKILL.md` when:

- the same root-cause mistake or validation failure appears more than once;
- the user corrects a material assumption the agent should not repeat;
- PR readiness, phase reporting, conflict triage, MCP, GitHub, IaC, or cloud setup exposes durable workflow friction;
- the user explicitly asks to record, promote, retire, or consult an agent learning.

Anti-bloat invariants:

- Keep this rule short.
- Do not import or inline `.cursor/LEARNINGS.md`.
- Do not import or inline `.cursor/learnings/*`.
- Only the skill loads learning index/detail content, and only on demand.
